    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crimen Exceptum</strong> is a spell-crafting action roguelike where you collect and combine powerful spells to take on various enemies in combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBINE POWERFUL SPELLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to your situation by combining individual spells to create a massive variety of magic to use as your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423240/extras/8352640ee12cc2dc224df9e353797e8a.poster.avif?t=1746781247\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423240/extras/8352640ee12cc2dc224df9e353797e8a.webm?t=1746781247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423240/extras/8352640ee12cc2dc224df9e353797e8a.mp4?t=1746781247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT THE NECROMANCER'S ENVOYS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your spells to engage in fast-paced combat against a range of unique enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423240/extras/fd8503b740e0be24bc41691e5b4de3bb.poster.avif?t=1746781247\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423240/extras/fd8503b740e0be24bc41691e5b4de3bb.webm?t=1746781247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423240/extras/fd8503b740e0be24bc41691e5b4de3bb.mp4?t=1746781247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AN ENCHANTED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter an ever-changing world filled with magic, diverse biomes, creatures, and mystical places waiting to be explored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423240/extras/9cb3508a5a8f82e6d5d4e71c469ba8a8.poster.avif?t=1746781247\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423240/extras/9cb3508a5a8f82e6d5d4e71c469ba8a8.webm?t=1746781247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423240/extras/9cb3508a5a8f82e6d5d4e71c469ba8a8.mp4?t=1746781247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crimen Exceptum</strong> is a spell-crafting action roguelike where you collect and combine powerful spells to take on various enemies in combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBINE POWERFUL SPELLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to your situation by combining individual spells to create a massive variety of magic to use as your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423240/extras/8352640ee12cc2dc224df9e353797e8a.poster.avif?t=1746781247\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423240/extras/8352640ee12cc2dc224df9e353797e8a.webm?t=1746781247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423240/extras/8352640ee12cc2dc224df9e353797e8a.mp4?t=1746781247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT THE NECROMANCER'S ENVOYS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your spells to engage in fast-paced combat against a range of unique enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423240/extras/fd8503b740e0be24bc41691e5b4de3bb.poster.avif?t=1746781247\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423240/extras/fd8503b740e0be24bc41691e5b4de3bb.webm?t=1746781247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423240/extras/fd8503b740e0be24bc41691e5b4de3bb.mp4?t=1746781247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AN ENCHANTED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter an ever-changing world filled with magic, diverse biomes, creatures, and mystical places waiting to be explored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423240/extras/9cb3508a5a8f82e6d5d4e71c469ba8a8.poster.avif?t=1746781247\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423240/extras/9cb3508a5a8f82e6d5d4e71c469ba8a8.webm?t=1746781247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423240/extras/9cb3508a5a8f82e6d5d4e71c469ba8a8.mp4?t=1746781247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
